WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.003
- [Gary] You have to deal with
the reality of the situation.

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.039
Dwelling and 
pondering and crying

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.007
doesn't do shit.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.910
And it especially doesn't do
shit in this echo chamber.

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:11.411
In this arena,

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.799
there is no crying.

00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:14.147
You can cry,

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.048
you're just gonna lose.

00:00:15.048 --> 00:00:17.184
And I have bad news about
complaining and crying.

00:00:17.184 --> 00:00:18.252
Let me tell you something

00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:19.853
about complaining and crying

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.622
that's really, really gonna hurt

00:00:21.622 --> 00:00:24.524
for all you 
complainers out there.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:29.096
Nobody gives a shit.

00:00:29.096 --> 00:00:32.866
(audience applause)

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.936
And let me give you a 
preview who gives a shit.

00:00:35.936 --> 00:00:39.398
The following people give 
a shit when you complain.

00:00:39.398 --> 00:00:42.602
The other losers around you,

00:00:44.278 --> 00:00:46.680
your sick broken parent

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.949
that secretly wants 
to hold you down

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:52.452
so that you're not more
successful than them,

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:54.354
and let me remind 
you one more time,

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.423
the other fucking 
losers around you.

